# Rule Configuration

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Rule Type | Scheduled |
| Query Frequency | Every 5 Minutes |
| Lookup Period | Last 1 Hour |
| Trigger Condition | Greater than 0 Results |
| Severity | Medium |
| Status | Enabled |

