# Entity Mapping

Proper entity mapping allows Microsoft Sentinel to correlate alerts across incidents.

| Entity | Field |
|---------|-------|
| IP Address | SourceIP |

Additional mappings such as Host, Account, or URL can be configured depending on the available telemetry.

