# Best Practices

- Start with simple detection logic before increasing complexity.
- Validate queries using historical log data.
- Tune thresholds to reduce unnecessary alerts.
- Use entity mapping for improved investigation.
- Map detections to the MITRE ATT&CK framework.
- Review detection performance regularly and refine rules as needed.

